            "displayAsButton": false,
            "buttonSize": "big",
            "goToSlideType": "specified",
            "invisible": false,
            "solution": ""
          },
          {
            "x": 2.23463687150838,
            "y": 13.245033112582783,
            "width": 92.73743016759778,
            "height": 86.09271523178808,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><strong>Early Life and Musical Beginnings</strong><br>\nSergei Rachmaninoff was born on April 1, 1873, in Semyonovo, Russia. He grew up in a music-loving family and displayed remarkable musical talent from an early age. By the time he was ten, he was accepted into the Saint Petersburg Conservatory, which set the foundation for his future as a composer, pianist, and conductor.</p>\n\n<p><strong>The Moscow Conservatory</strong><br>\nRachmaninoff transferred to the Moscow Conservatory in 1885, where he studied piano under Nikolai Zverev and composition under Sergei Taneyev and Anton Arensky. His time at the conservatory was crucial, culminating in the composition of his First Piano Concerto, Op. 1, which he completed at the age of 18 as a graduation requirement.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Early Struggles and Therapeutic Treatment</strong><br>\nDespite early successes, Rachmaninoff's Symphony No. 1 was poorly received, which led to a period of depression and low productivity. He sought the help of Dr. Nikolai Dahl, a therapist who used hypnotherapy to restore Rachmaninoff's self-confidence. This treatment was successful, and in 1901, he completed his Piano Concerto No. 2, Op. 18, which became one of his most famous compositions.</p>\n"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "contentType": "Text",
                "license": "U",
                "title": "Unbenannt: Text",
                "defaultLanguage": "en"
              },
              "subContentId": "53bc5361-5ce5-43a9-a00f-57bbceee9cd0"
            },
            "alwaysDisplayComments": false,
            "backgroundOpacity": 0,
            "displayAsButton": false,
            "buttonSize": "big",
            "goToSlideType": "specified",
            "invisible": false,
            "solution": ""
          }
